  16: def main(input_grid):
  17:     """
  18:     Reconstruct each indicated pattern at matching isolated indicator pixels, mirroring red-indicated patterns first.
  19: 
  20:     Input structure:
  21:     - The grid contains one or more multi-color patterns on a black background.
  22:     - Each pattern contains a red or green indicator pixel.
  23:     - Isolated red and green pixels elsewhere mark reconstruction targets.
  24: 
  25:     Rule:
  26:     - Separate larger pattern sprites from isolated indicator pixels.
  27:     - Mirror a pattern left-right when its embedded indicator is red.
